1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,567
How many English words do you really need?

2
00:00:02,567 --> 00:00:03,600
Less than you think.

3
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:11,633
Researchers estimate that about three thousand common word families cover most of the words in everyday English conversation.

4
00:00:12,833 --> 00:00:15,101
So start with the most common words.

5
00:00:15,101 --> 00:00:16,298
Use them every day.

6
00:00:16,298 --> 00:00:17,684
Talk with real people.

7
00:00:17,684 --> 00:00:19,699
And fluency grows, step by step.

